sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Hub as Hub (LLM Agent)
    participant API as Weather API
    participant ASM as asm.js + Guard Rail
    participant E1 as x86 Edge #1
    participant E2 as x86 Edge #2

    User->>Hub: "Get Seoul temperature,<br/>convert to Fahrenheit on CPU,<br/>and check network card status"

    Note over Hub: Agent Loop: Step 1

    Hub->>API: GET wttr.in/Seoul
    API-->>Hub: 25°C

    Note over Hub: Agent Loop: Step 2

    Hub->>Hub: LLM calls network_read_status()<br/>(auto-generated from device profile)
    Hub->>ASM: assemble profile ASM
    ASM-->>Hub: bytes [safe ✓]
    Hub->>E1: POST /poke (read NIC register)
    E1-->>Hub: eax=2148009859 → link UP

    Note over Hub: Agent Loop: Step 3

    Hub->>Hub: LLM generates Fahrenheit conversion:<br/>mov eax,25 → imul eax,9<br/>cdq → div 5 → add eax,32
    Hub->>ASM: assemble + scan
    ASM-->>Hub: bytes [safe ✓]
    Hub->>E2: POST /poke (compute)
    E2-->>Hub: eax=77

    Note over Hub: Agent Loop: Step 4

    Hub-->>User: Seoul: 25°C = 77°F<br/>NIC: link UP (e1000)
